      {
        "factor": "Senate action / passage risk",
        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "Lack of Senate passage or presidential action by May 1, 2026 represents a significant bottleneck; without Senate approval, enactment remains unlikely."
