    "synthesis_rationale": "Anchored at a ~4% base-rate, the combination of strong House momentum and a Senate companion provide some upside, but persistent Senate bottlenecks and the general rarity of enacted measures of this type pull the forecast toward the zero-to-low single-digit range. The 1% posterior reflects a calibrated, conservative view given current status and historical norms."
  }
}

